    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "In the wake of a severe weather event, water reserves were pushed to the edge as reservoirs filled beyond capacity. Human and natural forces breached barriers, causing the ancient river to rebel against its banks, and a man-made crossing surrendered to the surging flows. The inundation of settlements in the frontier regions left communities submerged, with a vital link severed and widespread property damage. This climatic anomaly triggered an evacuation operation, as rescue teams launched into the floodwaters, and a cross-border pact was forged to manage the crisis.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "how-4",
          "result-1",
          "result-2",
          "result-3",
          "result-4"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A frontier leader surveyed the devastation after an unprecedented rainy season created a rare weather frontier. The national authority ventured into the disaster zone to inspect the disaster impact, witnessing how waters carved new paths through inhabited lands. The maritime rescue force embarked on a rescue mission, while a neighboring state adjusted its flow in a diplomatic agreement on water management, attempting to mitigate the flood's reach.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "how-4",
          "how-5",
          "result-5",
          "result-4"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "how_fragments_expanded_to_contiguous_span"
      ],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Young victims of the flood were caught in the deluge after an extreme weather event overwhelmed infrastructure. The waterborne rescuers charted safe passages for an evacuation effort, deploying a fleet turned to humanitarian aid. This disaster outcome, marked by fatalities among children, exposed the harsh reality of a major waterway transforming into a channel of destruction. The crisis prompted an international cooperation measure, with an upstream power navigating shared waters to forge an agreement.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
